/*
 * import_temperatures - server side importer for temperatures.csv
 *
 * No byte offset is stored anywhere: the newest measured_at is read from the
 * database, the CSV is searched backwards (CSVUtil reads in both directions)
 * for that record and everything behind it is inserted. The search usually
 * reads a single line, worst case the file is read backwards and forwards once.
 *
 * The importer links the shared library (src_shared/libcore.a) but neither the
 * FOX toolkit nor any GUI code.
 *
 * See docs/mysql-import-plan.md
 */

